# --- Backend API origin (hosted only) ---
# Local dev: leave unset — the app uses relative '/api' via the Vite proxy.
# Vercel: set VITE_API_URL in the Vercel dashboard (Project → Settings →
# Environment Variables) to your Render backend, e.g.:
# VITE_API_URL=https://fintrack-viqo.onrender.com
# NOTE: Vite bakes env vars in at BUILD time — set the variable BEFORE
# deploying, and redeploy if you change it later.
